e,"is_acoholic_drink":false,"description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKỆ ÚP CHÉN BÁT TRÊN BÔN RỬA VANDO\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eKệ bát thông minh cho mọi căn bếp sạch sẽ, gọn gàng, giúp bạn hoàn chỉnh thiết kế nội thất gia đình\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/3e/03/c4/d3b74bf35bba5e528a76420bee25ab50.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/86/cf/41/6e83e1a8a839c30c81e7a524faf06134.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/86/cf/41/6e83e1a8a839c30c81e7a524faf06134.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/7c/8a/6d/708b1789282b97c62d91815945e84207.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/7c/8a/6d/708b1789282b97c62d91815945e84207.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eĐẶC ĐIỂM NỔI BẬT:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eKệ úp bát ráo nước trực tiếp trên bồn rửa giúp cho bát đĩa khô nhanh, thoáng khí, an toàn vệ sinh, tránh nấm mốc.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChất liệu Thép Carbon khổng gỉ được gia công tỉ mỉ, nghiêm ngặt.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eKết hợp 3 lớp sơn tĩnh điện: đặc biệt chống xước, chống bong tróc và dễ dàng vệ sinh.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMặt kệ 1 khối bắt ốc vào chân kệ nên sẽ không lo bị cong vênh như các loại mặt kệ treo.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChống trơn trượt: Chân kệ có mút cao su hít chặt mặt bàn - chống trơn, chống kéo xô lệch.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLòng kệ siêu lớn: Sâu 28cm để được 2 hàng bát lớn, thoải mái với hơn 40chiếc bát đĩa\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNgăn kệ thông minh: loại 2 tầng có 1 tầng kệ bằng để cốc chén, hoa quả, dụng cụ úp, giúp tăng diện tích và tính năng sử dụng.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMàu sắc: Đen nhám - sạch hơn, sang trọng hơn cho căn bếp thêm đẳng cấp.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/cb/59/f0/c93f26696b069376635eb039113eccaf.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/cb/59/f0/c93f26696b069376635eb039113eccaf.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/64/f4/ed/1761f2716a34708a02744c8541741e7b.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/64/f4/ed/1761f2716a34708a02744c8541741e7b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/36/8f/85/cec2281fd0bc2ca7a1124e454e0134ec.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/36/8f/85/cec2281fd0bc2ca7a1124e454e0134ec.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/a4/39/a5/7ee0fd46cc6d2e3ffaa6a5109a90dad0.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/a4/39/a5/7ee0fd46cc6d2e3ffaa6a5109a90dad0.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/ae/31/e3/70fc0a5e80d05114a70b945633085a5b.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/ae/31/e3/70fc0a5e80d05114a70b945633085a5b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/9c/68/7c/6a42b5c131489ea9e9e84db1fef95649.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/9c/68/7c/6a42b5c131489ea9e9e84db1fef95649.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/8e/9c/3a/67c6cd159eb26f775e92e0da3bb5c52c.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/8e/9c/3a/67c6cd159eb26f775e92e0da3bb5c52c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts